  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. In a large heatproof bowl, place couscous, the salt and butter.\n• Add the boiling water (3/4 cup for 2P / 11/2 cups for 4P) and stir to combine.\n• Immediately cover with a plate and leave for 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648ad430d8e7c0c766b893/step-7479b700.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.\n• Roughly chop cucumber.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648ad430d8e7c0c766b893/step-25e8b710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook chickpeas, tossing, until tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Add tomato & herb seasoning and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in the water and a pinch of brown sugar and simmer until slightly thickened, 1 min. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648ad430d8e7c0c766b893/step-bd6be520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add tomato, cucumber and salad leaves to the couscous.\n• Add a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Toss to combine and season to taste.\n• Divide veggie couscous between bowls, then top with herby tomato chickpeas.\n• Crumble over fetta cubes. Dollop with yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648ad430d8e7c0c766b893/step-718a8430.jpg"
    }
  ]
